---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Residential Architecture | ATECT Architecture" description="Residential architectural design for additions, renovations, custom homes and improvements throughout Maryland, Washington, DC and Northern Virginia.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Residential Architecture</div>
    <h1>Thoughtful residential design for the way you live.</h1>
    <p>ATECT Architecture provides residential design and construction-document services for homeowners planning additions, renovations, custom homes and other residential improvements.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section service-intro">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <div class="eyebrow">ATECT Architecture</div>
      <h2>Residential design that connects ideas to buildable documentation.</h2>
      <p>ATECT Architecture provides residential design and construction-document services for homeowners planning additions, renovations, custom homes and other residential improvements.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-grid">
      <article class="service-card"><span>01</span><h3>Home additions and expansions</h3><p>Developed as part of a coordinated architectural design process based on the needs and scope of the project.</p></article>
      <article class="service-card"><span>02</span><h3>Whole-home renovations</h3><p>Developed as part of a coordinated architectural design process based on the needs and scope of the project.</p></article>
      <article class="service-card"><span>03</span><h3>Custom residential design</h3><p>Developed as part of a coordinated architectural design process based on the needs and scope of the project.</p></article>
      <article class="service-card"><span>04</span><h3>Floor plans and elevations</h3><p>Developed as part of a coordinated architectural design process based on the needs and scope of the project.</p></article>
      <article class="service-card"><span>05</span><h3>Construction-document development</h3><p>Developed as part of a coordinated architectural design process based on the needs and scope of the project.</p></article>
      <article class="service-card"><span>06</span><h3>3-D visualization and design studies</h3><p>Developed as part of a coordinated architectural design process based on the needs and scope of the project.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section process-band">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">How We Work</div>
      <h2>Design. Document. Move forward.</h2>
      <p>ATECT can support a project from early planning through design development, construction documentation and the next phase of the project. Scope is tailored to the work required.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button" href="/process">Explore Our Process</a>
  </section>

  <section class="section links-section">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <div class="eyebrow">Explore ATECT</div>
      <h2>See related work and services.</h2>
      <p>Explore projects, visualization and the services that support the design process.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="link-grid">
      <a href="/projects/residential"><strong>Residential Projects</strong><span>View residential work →</span></a>
      <a href="/projects/commercial"><strong>Commercial Projects</strong><span>View commercial work →</span></a>
      <a href="/3d-renderings"><strong>3-D Renderings</strong><span>Explore visualization →</span></a>
      <a href="/contact" class="dark"><strong>Start a Project</strong><span>Contact ATECT →</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
.service-intro{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.section-intro{max-width:760px;margin-bottom:38px}
.section-intro h2{font:600 clamp(32px,4vw,52px)/1.05 Manrope;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0 14px}
.section-intro p,.process-band p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75}
.service-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.service-card{padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff}
.service-card span{font:600 13px Manrope;color:#777}
.service-card h3{font:600 22px/1.2 Manrope;margin:20px 0 10px}
.service-card p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;margin:0}
.process-band{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:40px;background:var(--paper);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.process-band h2{font:600 clamp(30px,4vw,48px)/1.05 Manrope;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0 12px}
.process-band>div{max-width:760px}
.links-section{text-align:center}
.links-section .section-intro{margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.link-grid{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;text-align:left}
.link-grid a{min-height:120px;padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;transition:transform .2s ease,border-color .2s ease}
.link-grid a:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:#111}
.link-grid strong{font:600 18px/1.3 Manrope}
.link-grid span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.link-grid .dark{background:#111820;color:#fff;border-color:#111820}
.link-grid .dark span{color:#d9dde0}
@media(max-width:900px){.service-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.link-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.process-band{display:block}.process-band .button{margin-top:24px}}
@media(max-width:560px){.service-grid,.link-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.service-card{padding:24px}.process-band{padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px}}
</style>